{"seq":14,"trial_id":"gbrain-scoped-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-scoped-mu-heldout/sd-03-coastal-week-ahead/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T13:23:14.705Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"ecc303fa20e7641992030e3bf11f101ddce067ae843ad44f37e91975321e2103","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Bettina, I've set up the 'Coastal week ahead' digest for #coastal-team, covering #coastal-team and #coastal-random: last week's messages plus open customer items. It runs Mondays at 08:00 Chicago time (13:00 UTC). Two caveats. The scheduler isn't running yet, so nothing will post until the Hermes gateway is started. And I couldn't schedule a one-off run for Monday 19 Oct because the scheduler's clock is already past that date, so the first automatic run will be the next Monday it fires. The digest won't include finance figures or anything from DMs.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000127","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-scoped-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-scoped-mu-heldout/sd-03-coastal-week-ahead/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T13:23:18.460Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"e2a1e123ee261fe37e6d4e152028fe71a4b125df07e87d65bb9a666c5a6447cd","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Correction to my last message, Bettina: the scheduler reports its next run as Monday 2 Nov 2026 at 08:00 Chicago time. It does not cover Monday 19 Oct or Monday 26 Oct, because the scheduler's clock is ahead of the simulation clock. I can't fix that from here, so someone with access to the scheduler will need to check it before the 19 Oct start.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000128","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
